		],
		"en": [
			"• Cool glasses that allow you to see everything secretly!",
			"• The cheat glass that appears on the TV program \"Pochitto Invention Pikachin Kit\" has been commercialized!",
			"• A cheating glass is an invention that allows you to secretly look to the side while facing forward!",
			"• Watch the letter written by the girl sitting next to you without knowing it!",
			"• It also comes with a Pikachin sheet that can be bound into the Pikachin Encyclopedia!"
		]
